<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="cta-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-copy" data-reveal>
      <p class="cta-kicker">Contact</p>
      <h2>まずは無料でご相談ください</h2>
      <p class="lede">アイデア段階でも構いません。お気軽にご相談ください。</p>
      <p class="note">内容を確認し、通常2営業日以内にご連絡します。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="form-wrap" id="form" data-reveal style="--delay:80ms">
      <form class="form" data-contact-form>
        <div class="row">
          <label>
            <span class="lbl">お名前<span class="req">必須</span></span>
            <input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required />
          </label>
          <label>
            <span class="lbl">会社名</span>
            <input name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" />
          </label>
        </div>
        <label>
          <span class="lbl">メールアドレス<span class="req">必須</span></span>
          <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          <span class="lbl">ご相談の種類</span>
          <select name="type">
            <option>Webアプリ</option>
            <option>Webサイト</option>
            <option>スマホアプリ</option>
            <option>API開発</option>
            <option>既存システムの改修</option>
            <option>まだ決まっていない</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <label>
          <span class="lbl">相談内容<span class="req">必須</span></span>
          <textarea name="message" rows="5" required placeholder="今困っていること、作りたいもののイメージなど"></textarea>
        </label>
        <p class="error">お名前・メール・内容を入力してください。</p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">送信する</button>
      </form>
      <div class="success" data-form-success hidden>
        <h3>受け取りました</h3>
        <p>内容を確認し、通常2営業日以内にご連絡します。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1f2c 0%, #242c40 100%);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 80px 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 16px);
  }

  .cta-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    background:
      radial-gradient(480px 260px at 85% 20%, rgba(107, 140, 255, 0.22), transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(360px 220px at 8% 90%, rgba(107, 140, 255, 0.12), transparent 60%);
  }

  .contact-grid {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.88fr) minmax(0, 1.12fr);
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .cta-kicker {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.6vw, 1.9rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.015em;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .lede {
    margin-top: 12px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .note {
    margin-top: 18px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .contact-copy {
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .form-wrap {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .form,
  .success {
    display: grid;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 32px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--text);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
  }

  .form[hidden],
  .success[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }

  .row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
  }

  label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lbl {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .req {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 1px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: rgba(196, 92, 92, 0.1);
    color: #c45c5c;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  input,
  select,
  textarea {
    width: 100%;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    padding: 13px 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  input:focus,
  select:focus,
  textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 116, 232, 0.14);
  }

  textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .error {
    display: none;
    margin: 0;
    color: #c45c5c;
    font-size: 13px;
  }

  .form.is-invalid .error {
    display: block;
  }

  .success h3 {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }

  .success p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .form,
    .success {
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }
  }
</style>
